WEBVTT

NOTE
Kind: captions
Source: Articulate Closed Captions Editor
Source Version: 3.103.35263.0

00:00:00.239 --> 00:00:02.509
Sometimes life can feel very overwhelming.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:03.750
You have work to do,

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.110
emails to answer,

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:06.210
calls to take,

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.510
meetings to join,

00:00:07.599 --> 00:00:09.300
and assignments to complete.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.869
Never mind all of the personal things you have to maintain at home.

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:16.909
It can feel like there aren't enough hours in the day to get everything done,

00:00:17.159 --> 00:00:18.479
which can feel overwhelming,

00:00:18.719 --> 00:00:20.670
frustrating and stressful.

00:00:21.159 --> 00:00:23.100
Sometimes we need to take a step back,

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:28.530
look at each task separately and see how we can break it down into smaller tasks.

00:00:28.879 --> 00:00:33.189
Learning time management techniques can help to make life feel easier to manage.

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:36.389
Instead of feeling like you have one huge task to battle,

00:00:36.919 --> 00:00:39.909
you now have lots of little ones that are much easier to take on.

00:00:40.419 --> 00:00:42.560
There are many time management techniques,

00:00:42.689 --> 00:00:44.810
each one to suit different needs.

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:47.090
The goal is to find what works for you and

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:50.360
what helps you feel better equipped to battle life's tasks.

00:00:50.689 --> 00:00:52.610
Welcome to this time management course.

00:00:52.889 --> 00:00:53.520
By the end of it,

00:00:53.529 --> 00:00:56.560
you should feel less like you are carrying the world on your back

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:58.680
and more like you are stood on top of it.

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:00.250
Let's get started.

